libobs declarations
-------------------
crates/obs-avip-plugin declares the libobs and obs-frontend-api functions and
structs it uses, following the libobs headers of OBS Studio and obs-rust
(GPL-2.0-or-later).

DistroAV compatibility
----------------------
The source and output ids, settings keys, defaults and value rules follow
DistroAV (https://github.com/DistroAV/DistroAV, GPL-2.0), so that scene
collections and profiles saved by DistroAV load unchanged.
